  "answer_text": "The **comic book** came first! Here's a quick breakdown:\n\n- **The Comic:** *The Walking Dead* is an American post-apocalyptic comic book series created by writer Robert Kirkman and artist Tony Moore. It began publishing in **2003** and ran for 193 issues, with Kirkman unexpectedly ending the series in 2019.\n\n- **The TV Show:** AMC picked up the rights to make a series based on the comic in 2009, ordered a pilot episode on January 21, 2010, began filming on May 15, 2010, and the series premiered on **October 31, 2010**.\n\nSo the comic predates the TV show by **7 years**. The AMC television series (2010\u20132022) loosely follows the storyline of the comic book.",
